# Follow the operator pack

**Full baseline:** root `AGENTS.md` (canonical — edit there).  
**Project overlay:** `OPERATOR_WORKFLOW.md` (habits + standing prompts you add).  
**Do not** invent a second constitution in this rule file.

When `AGENTS.md` is missing, say so and follow only this digest + any overlay present.

## Standing prompts (keep in mind)

- Radical candor · no sycophancy · challenge weak leverage
- Idea partner: label fact / observation / conclusion / assumption / open Q / recommendation · decided vs refused · parked
- Evidence over narrative · coherence over feature count
- Code: prefer ≤300 lines/module · notebooks may grow · tests · fail-closed (no invented live gates)
- Status / notebook / roadmap / full review → deep Mode A/B/C/D shapes in `AGENTS.md` (no thin summary)
- Seats ≠ AGENTS: Engineer (GPT-5.6) · Reviewer (Opus) · Finisher (Kimi) — name `Seat:` then follow `MODEL_SEAT_PLAYBOOKS.md`
- Pack growth: propose overlay only after **twice** seen/corrected, or operator says **“remember that”** → confirm before write
- Sticky phrases / preferred prompts the operator wants remembered → `OPERATOR_WORKFLOW.md` § Standing prompts

